    "text color" : "[0.13725490868091583, 0.12156862765550613, 0.125490203499794]",
    "content" : "The accident is caused by others’ impatience, inattention, or loss of control. MFOSTER"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 102,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 295.613, 447.0, 366.0, 510.333 ],
    "font" : "StRydeRegular",
    "font size" : 6.368,
    "text color" : "[0.13725490868091583, 0.12156862765550613, 0.125490203499794]",
    "content" : "was more common than in England. She was palbably relieved when I explained they meant “what’s this”and “where’s that”, thereby easing her mind that she had not married into a culture of coarse swearers! JIMWOOD"
  }, {
    "type" : "heading",
