    "font" : "Stag-Bold",
    "font size" : 8.99,
    "text color" : "[0.13725490868091583, 0.12156862765550613, 0.125490203499794]",
    "content" : "Goodcleanfun onthebeach"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 122,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 295.333, 296.667, 368.0, 397.333 ],
    "font" : "StRydeRegular",
    "font size" : 6.368,
    "text color" : "[0.13725490868091583, 0.12156862765550613, 0.125490203499794]",
    "content" : "It’s not just the Australians who can celebrate without leaving masses of litter. On holiday in the South of France last summer, we were among thousands who ﬁlled the beach and streets at Valras-Plage to watch a spectacular ﬁrework display celebrating le 14 Juillet. When everyone left, the beach was spotless! LYNNEPEMBERTON"
